# AI agent modes and the harness > Validate mode
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/agent-modes.md#L290
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

run::a Run the validate mode ::e --> validate mode ::c, writes findings only ::c

check::a Check the branch markers and SVGs ::e
  --> validate::a Validate the branch graphs ::e
  --> report::a Write the findings ::e
check, validate, report --::P--> run

agent::a coding agent --> check, validate, report
md-embed --> check
ipm-validate --> validate
wt::a design worktree --> check, validate
findings::a findings note --> report

agent --> AI agent ::c
md-embed --> embedder ::c
ipm-validate --> validator ::c
wt --> design workspace ::c
findings --> diagnostic ::c, output ::c
